{"language_code":"eng","language_probability":0.9883938431739807,"text":"We grew up in a world that told us the future belonged to those who could code. Knowing how something should look and feel wasn't enough. You had to know how to build it, too. But now everything's shifted. Code is a material, as shapeable as texture or color, and ideas no longer have to wait their turn. So now the question isn't can it be made? It's what would you make if you could make anything? You'd probably start by following your curiosity, going wide before going deep, making and remaking until it feels right. The point isn't just to make it faster, it's to take it further together. The future doesn't just happen. It's built by design.","words":[{"text":"We","start":0.68,"end":0.76,"type":"word","logprob":-0.0004390706308186054},{"text":" ","start":0.76,"end":0.84,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.00014006110723130405},{"text":"grew","start":0.84,"end":1.0,"type":"word","logprob":-0.00014006110723130405},{"text":" ","start":1.0,"end":1.08,"type":"spacing","logprob":0.0},{"text":"up","start":1.08,"end":1.18,"type":"word","logprob":0.0},{"text":" ","start":1.18,"end":1.22,"type":"spacing","logprob":0.0},{"text":"in","start":1.22,"end":1.28,"type":"word","logprob":0.0},{"text":" ","start":1.28,"end":1.32,"type":"spacing","logprob":0.0},{"text":"a","start":1.32,"end":1.36,"type":"word","logprob":0.0},{"text":" ","start":1.36,"end":1.42,"type":"spacing","logprob":-3.3378546504536644e-6},{"text":"world","start":1.42,"end":1.68,"type":"word","logprob":-3.3378546504536644e-6},{"text":" ","start":1.68,"end":1.74,"type":"spacing","logprob":0.0},{"text":"that","start":1.74,"end":1.86,"type":"word","logprob":0.0},{"text":" ","start":1.86,"end":1.92,"type":"spacing","logprob":-1.1920928244535389e-7},{"text":"told","start":1.92,"end":2.1,"type":"word","logprob":-1.1920928244535389e-7},{"text":" ","start":2.1,"end":2.16,"type":"spacing","logprob":0.0},{"text":"us","start":2.16,"end":2.34,"type":"word","logp